Subject: [PATCH v2 04/17] soundwire: cadence: handle error cases with CONFIG_UPDATE
Date:   Tue, 17 Mar 2020 11:33:16 -0500
Message-Id: <20200317163329.25501-5-pierre-louis.bossart@linux.intel.com>
